998/Math/MathML\"><mi>span</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">u</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> pointwise and rotates the\nplane <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{span}(\\mathbf{u})^{\\perp}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c70\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42E TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22A5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>span</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">u</mi></mrow><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>⊥</mo></mrow></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> by\n<span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\theta\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D703 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>θ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</p>","file":"ch12-spectral-theory/06-orthogonal-matrices-and-rotations.html"}